; Tenant identifier (FIWARE convention, matches Orion-LD / Scorpio).
;
; Restricts tenants to `[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]{0,49}` so they are safe as
; Postgres database / schema names. The 50-char maximum is enforced by the
; Rust wrapper since ABNF regular grammars cannot cheaply encode upper
; length bounds.

TenantName  = tenantStart *tenantChar
tenantStart = %x41-5A / %x61-7A / %x5F            ; A-Z a-z _
tenantChar  = %x30-39 / %x41-5A / %x61-7A / %x5F  ; 0-9 A-Z a-z _
